---
import SocialList from "@/components/SocialList.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description:
		"Strawhat builds autonomous robotic swarms driven by custom Gemma-based models on edge hardware and decentralized blockchain coordination.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<section data-pagefind-body>
		<h1 class="title mb-2">About Us</h1>
		<p class="text-muted mb-6">Empowering autonomous robotic swarms.</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			At Strawhat, we specialize in building autonomous and intelligent robotic systems driven by
			custom Gemma-based language models and decentralized blockchain coordination. By leveraging
			Google's open-weights Gemma architecture, we deploy highly efficient AI models directly onto
			robotic edge hardware. This empowers machines with domain-specific reasoning and fast
			visual-language execution without cloud reliance.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			To solve complex multi-agent challenges, our systems utilize blockchain technology to
			facilitate trustless, decentralized coordination. Robots in a swarm can verify tasks, share
			situational intelligence, and execute multi-agent contracts autonomously. This distributed
			framework guarantees auditability, data integrity, and resilient peer-to-peer decision-making
			across complex physical networks.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			By bringing together efficient edge AI, specialized Gemma models, and decentralized
			blockchain networks, Strawhat unlocks total operational independence for modern robotics. We
			enable organizations to deploy secure, self-coordinating robotic swarms designed to meet the
			demands of enterprise automation.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-12">
			<SocialList />
		</div>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
